    "title": "CRESCENT CVM Gen 0 derived from the MCMC inversion of ambient noise dispersion and receiver functions",
    "summary": "CRESCENT CVM Gen 0 was created from the joint inversion of ambient noise Rayleigh waves dispersion measurements (onshore and offshore) using FMST and adaptive CCP-derived receiver functions (onshore only) (see He et al., 2026 for details of this model). This file was also interpolated onto a regular 0.2 x 0.2 deg grid, which makes it slightly different from the calculated model. Bins without a data constraint within 0.3 degs were set to \"nan\"",
